<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank repo allocates 17 bln skr to market.</title>
<headline>Riksbank repo allocates 17 bln skr to market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Riksbank said on Tuesday it injected 17 billion crowns into the market in this morning's weekly repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The repurchase rate was set at a fixed rate of 4.10 percent, unchanged from last week's rate. It will run from May 7 to May 14 and replaces an operation which allocated 15 billion crowns to the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 56.38 percent of the bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
